    <comment>Hello,

I would like to submit the `krohnkite` package to `X11:windowmanager`.

`X11:windowmanager` is the ideal home for this package because Krohnkite is a window management tool—specifically, a dynamic tiling extension for KWin 6 that brings advanced tiling (dwm-style) capabilities to the desktop environment. Placing it here makes it easily discoverable for openSUSE users looking for window management and tiling enhancements.

Name: krohnkite
Summary: Dynamic tiling extension for KWin 6
Upstream URL: https://codeberg.org/anametologin/Krohnkite
License: MIT
Status: Builds cleanly and uses automated `tar_scm` source services.

Thank you for reviewing!</comment>
